#: Game.Levels.EquivWorld.L04_equiv
msgid "## **Level 4**\n"
"The goal of this level is intuitively clear. But in order to prove it formally, we'll need some **targeted rewrites** with §0. 🔍 Check out the entry for §1 in the **Theorems** tab. 👉 To get started, try:\n"
"§2"
